   "date": "2020-12-03",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Industrial Chemicals Legislation Amendment Bill 2020 enables collection of a scheduling charge alongside the existing registration charge under the Industrial Chemicals Act 2019, reduces administrative burden on business, clarifies payment management, and corrects a drafting error in delegation powers."
  }
